OL,3,GNEWSANew inquest hope for siblings
OL,4,Afound dead in farmhouse 50 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FRelatives trying to clear the name of
OL,7,Fan elderly brother posthumously accused
OL,8,Fof murdering his sister in their
OL,9,Ffarmhouse nearly 50 years ago are
OL,10,Fhoping for a new inquest into the
OL,11,Fdeaths after meeting a senior coroner.
OL,13,FThe bodies of Martha and Griff Thomas
OL,14,Fwere found at Ffynnon Samson farmhouse
OL,15,Fin Llangolman, Pembrokeshire in 1976,
OL,16,Finitially prompting a double murder
OL,17,Finvestigation.
OL,19,FAn inquest in 1977 found Martha Thomas,
OL,20,Fwho was 70, was unlawfully killed,
OL,21,Fwhile an open verdict was returned for
OL,22,FGriff Thomas, who was 73.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
